Subject: [PATCH 19/19] tests: gfx900 cases

test-backend-ops correctness and perf cases for the changes above: GCN matvec shapes, the tile kernel's
quantized-cache shapes (GQA 6 per card under tensor split), single-token and windowed attention, GEMM
attention prompt shapes, get_rows/concat layouts. GGML_TEST_PRINT_ERR=1 also prints the error of
passing cases.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TS8XWm5bp2cWmYvbQ5tTBK
